(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - Time = 4 hours (including $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop)
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Convert 4 hours to minutes:  
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $ 4 \times 60 = 240 $ minutes.
