(TaskRunner pid=[process]) So, the **total time in minutes** is $ 240 + t $.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) The time to walk 9 km at speed $ s $ is:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
