(TaskRunner pid=[process]) ### Step 1: Understand the Geometry
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) In a **rhombus**, the **diagonals bisect each other at right angles** (not necessarily in this case, but in general, they bisect each other and are perpendicular). However, in this problem, the **diagonals intersect at the origin**, which is the **center** of the hyperbola.
