(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - $B = (0, b)$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - $C = (a, 0)$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - $D = (0, -b)$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Now, check if all four points lie on the hyperbola.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) #### Check point $A = (-a, 0)$:
