(TaskRunner pid=[process]) [response] We are given:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - Aya walks **9 km** each morning.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - She walks at a **constant speed of $ s $ km/h**.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - The walk takes **4 hours**, including **$ t $ minutes** spent in the coffee shop.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - When she walks at **$ s + 2 $ km/h**, the walk takes **2 hours and 24 minutes**, including **$ t $ minutes** spent in the coffee shop.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - We are to find the time it takes her to walk **$ s + \frac{1}{2} $** km/h, including **$ t $ minutes** spent in the coffee shop.
