(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) -18 = -1.6s(s + 2)
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Divide both sides by -1.6:
