(TaskRunner pid=[process]) ---
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) ### **Step 4: Solve the Quadratic Equation**
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) s^2 + 2s - 11.25 = 0
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Use the quadratic formula:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) s = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4 + 4 \cdot 11.25}}{2}
